OL,3,GNEWSAFifth day of rail disruption west
OL,4,Aof Paddington
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers face a fifth day of
OL,7,Freduced services west of London
OL,8,FPaddington after a fire damaged power
OL,9,Fequipment beside the tracks.
OL,11,FThe Elizabeth line is running only two
OL,12,Ftrains an hour to Heathrow and Reading,
OL,13,Fwhile Great Western Railway and
OL,14,FHeathrow Express services have also
OL,15,Fbeen cut.
OL,17,FThe fire broke out at Scrubs Lane in
OL,18,FKensal Green on Saturday afternoon,
OL,19,Fdamaging an electrical substation and
OL,20,Fcabling supplying the overhead lines.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
